Component 2: Schedule Management
Why this component is important
Schedule management is important because it allows IT staff to create and manage class timetables.

The schedule feature affects both:
Students
Teachers

Students use schedules to know when their classes happen. Teachers use schedules to know when and where they teach.

If this component does not work correctly:
students may see incorrect class times
teachers may have incorrect teaching schedules
classrooms may be wrong
IT staff may not be able to correct mistakes

The tested schedule features include:
Create schedule
View all schedules
Update schedule
Delete schedule

These features are available only to IT staff.

