6. Running the Tests

To run the tests, first install pytest:
pip install pytest

Then run:
pytest

or:
pytest tests/test_system.py

Before running the tests, the database should be created and seeded:
python database/init_db.py
python fix_seed_passwords.py

Then start testing.

Expected Test Output
If the tests pass, the terminal should show a result similar to:
============================= test session starts =============================
collected 18 items
tests/test_system.py ..................                              [100%]
============================== 18 passed in 2.35s ==============================

This means the selected components passed the test cases successfully.

