10. Conclusion
Software testing was an important phase of this project because it helped verify that the main components of the system work correctly.

The selected components were:
Login Function
Schedule Management
Announcement Management

These components were chosen because they directly affect security, communication, and daily school operations.
The test cases included valid inputs, invalid inputs, missing data, and unauthorized access scenarios. The test code used Flask’s test client and pytest to automatically check the expected system behavior.

Overall, the testing phase improved confidence in the system and showed that the High School Management System is reliable, organized, and ready for demonstration.
